= AlbumType2 Template Documentation =
This template creates a standardized layout for album pages with tabbed sections for tracklist, shops/downloads, and streaming services.

== Usage ==
<pre>
{{AlbumType2
|albumtitle=
|singers=
|datereleased=
|label=
|albumartist=
|image=
|track=
|shops=
|jpshops=
|streams=
|spotifyalbumid=
|crossfadeyt=
|crossfadennd=
|ytxfddesc=
|nndxfddesc=
}}
</pre>

== Parameters ==
=== Basic Information Parameters ===
{| class="wikitable"
! Parameter !! Description !! Required? !! Example
|-
| albumtitle || The title of the album || Yes || <code>My Album Title</code>
|-
| singers || Featured artists on the album || No || <code>Artist A, Artist B</code>
|-
| datereleased || Release date of the album || Yes || <code>July 07, 2024</code>
|-
| label || Record label or publisher || No || <code>Universal Music</code>
|-
| albumartist || Artist who created the album artwork || No || <code>Cover Artist Name</code>
|-
| image || Filename of the album cover image || No || <code>Album_cover.jpg</code>
|}

=== Media Player Parameters ===
{| class="wikitable"
! Parameter !! Description !! Format !! Example
|-
| spotifyalbumid || Spotify album ID for embedded player || Spotify album ID || <code>3y5m8YvNm0yGHYoi4ada4V</code>
|-
| crossfadeyt || YouTube crossfade preview ID || YouTube video ID || <code>7oYbEQ1_pjg</code>
|-
| crossfadennd || Niconico crossfade preview ID || Niconico video ID || <code>sm20071610</code>
|-
| ytxfddesc || YouTube crossfade description || Text || <code>Album Crossfade</code>
|-
| nndxfddesc || Niconico crossfade description || Text || <code>Album Crossfade</code>
|}

=== Track Template Parameters ===
{| class="wikitable"
! Parameter !! Description !! Required? !! Example
|-
| number || Track number || Yes || <code>1</code>
|-
| title || Song title || Yes || <code>Song Title</code> or <code><ruby>星空<rt>ほしぞら</rt></ruby></code>
|-
| additionalshortinfo || Additional information || No || <code>Single</code> or <code><nowiki>{{yt|dQw4w9WgXcQ}}</nowiki></code>
|-
| singers || Track artists || No || <code>Artist Name</code>
|-
| lyricist || Lyric writer || No || <code>Lyricist Name</code>
|-
| composer || Music composer || No || <code>Composer Name</code>
|-
| arranger || Music arranger || No || <code>Arranger Name</code>
|-
| collapsible || Makes track info collapsible || No || <code>y</code>
|}

=== Shop Section Types ===
{| class="wikitable"
! Section !! Parameter !! Description !! Example
|-
| International Shops || shops || Links to international stores || <code><nowiki>{{LType2|amazon|149104}}</nowiki></code>
|-
| Japan Only || jpshops || Links to Japanese stores || <code><nowiki>{{LType2|amazon|149104}}</nowiki></code>
|-
| Streaming Services || streams || Links to streaming platforms || <code><nowiki>{{LType2|spotify|3y5m8YvNm0yGHYoi4ada4V}}</nowiki></code>
|}

== Examples ==

=== Basic Usage ===
<pre>
{{AlbumType2
|albumtitle=Album Name
|singers=Artist Name
|datereleased=January 1, 2024
|label=Label Name
|track=
{{Track|1|title=Song Title|singers=Artist}}
}}
</pre>
Output:
{{AlbumType2
|albumtitle=Album Name
|singers=Artist Name
|datereleased=January 1, 2024
|label=Label Name
|track={{Track|1|title=Song Title|singers=Artist}}
}}

