== Notes ==
* Track titles support line breaks using <nowiki><br /></nowiki>
* Japanese text can be annotated with readings using <nowiki><ruby></nowiki> tags
* Crossfade previews are only shown when video IDs are provided
* Shop sections will collapse if no links are provided

